---
// ⚠️ DRAFT FOR LEGAL REVIEW — not final legal text. Have a lawyer / DPO check
// it (GDPR + Greek law 4624/2019 + ePrivacy) before relying on it, and fill in
// the [bracketed] items (GA4 retention, form retention).
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import MenuOverlay from "../components/MenuOverlay.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---
<Base title="Privacy & cookie policy — Untitled Office" description="How Untitled Office uses cookies, Google Analytics and contact-form data.">
  <MenuOverlay />
  <Header />
  <main>
    <article class="pv edge">
      <h1 class="pv-title">Privacy &amp; cookie policy</h1>
      <p class="pv-meta mono">Last updated: 05-10-2026</p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        This website is run by Untitled Office, Ippokratous 7, 106 79 Athens, Greece.
        For anything about your data, email <a class="u-link" href="mailto:info@untitledoffice.gr" data-umami-event="contact_click" data-umami-event-type="email">info@untitledoffice.gr</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect, and why</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Analytics (only with your consent).</strong> If you allow analytics cookies, we use
        Google Analytics 4, loaded through Google Tag Manager, to understand how the site is used:
        pages visited, time on page, how you arrived (for example a search or a link), device and
        browser type, and approximate location (country and city). Google Analytics 4 does not store
        IP addresses. We don’t use this data for advertising and don’t combine it with other data.
        It is kept for [14 months — set in our GA4 account].
      </p>
      <p>
        Without your consent, Google Tag Manager still loads, but analytics cookies are not set.
        Google may receive limited, cookieless signals (Consent Mode) that cannot identify you.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Cookieless statistics (no consent needed).</strong> For basic visitor numbers we also
        use Umami Cloud, which runs for every visitor. It sets no cookies and stores nothing on your
        device. It collects anonymous, aggregated usage data only (pages viewed, referring site,
        browser, device type and country) and some interactions, such as which project or link was
        clicked, never anything you type or your contact details. It can’t identify you, isn’t used for
        profiling and isn’t combined with other data. We rely on our legitimate interest in
        understanding, at an aggregate level, how the site is used (GDPR Art. 6(1)(f)).
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Contact form.</strong> When you send the contact form, we receive the details you
        enter (name, telephone, e-mail, website, budget and your message). The form is handled by
        Netlify Forms, our hosting provider, which stores the submission and forwards it to us. We
        use it only to reply to your enquiry and keep it for as long as needed for that
        [and any follow-up work].
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <div class="pv-table-wrap">
        <table class="pv-table">
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Cookie</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th><th>Type</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td><code>cc_cookie</code></td><td>Remembers your cookie choice</td><td>6 months</td><td>Necessary</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>_ga</code></td><td>Tells visits apart (Google Analytics)</td><td>2 years</td><td>Analytics, with consent</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>_ga_&lt;ID&gt;</code></td><td>Keeps session state (Google Analytics)</td><td>2 years</td><td>Analytics, with consent</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p>We also remember your light/dark and colour choice in your browser’s local storage; this is not sent to us.</p>

      <h2>Legal basis</h2>
      <p>
        Analytics cookies are used only with your consent (GDPR Art. 6(1)(a) and the ePrivacy rules).
        The consent cookie is strictly necessary to remember your choice. Umami’s cookieless,
        anonymous statistics are based on our legitimate interest (GDPR Art. 6(1)(f)). Contact-form data is used
        to answer your request (GDPR Art. 6(1)(b)).
      </p>

      <h2>Changing your mind</h2>
      <p>
        You can change or withdraw consent at any time:
        <button type="button" class="pv-btn u-link" data-cc-settings>open cookie settings</button>
        (also linked in the footer). If you switch analytics off, we remove the Google Analytics cookies.
      </p>

      <h2>Who else processes data</h2>
      <p>
        Google (Google Analytics, Google Tag Manager), Umami Software (Umami Cloud statistics) and
        Netlify (hosting and forms) process data on our behalf. Some of this may happen outside the EU, under the safeguards these providers
        offer (such as the EU–US Data Privacy Framework and standard contractual clauses).
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask us for access to, correction or deletion of your data, or object to or restrict
        its use, by emailing <a class="u-link" href="mailto:info@untitledoffice.gr" data-umami-event="contact_click" data-umami-event-type="email">info@untitledoffice.gr</a>.
        You can also complain to the Hellenic Data Protection Authority (dpa.gr).
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  .pv {
    max-width: calc(44rem + 2 * var(--edge));
    padding-top: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 3rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
  }
  .pv-title {
    font-family: var(--ff-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .pv-meta { color: var(--muted); margin: 1rem 0 0; }
  .pv h2 {
    font-family: var(--ff-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.6vw, 1.5rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem) 0 0.6rem;
  }
  .pv p { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 1em; }
  .pv strong { font-weight: 500; }
  .pv-table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; margin: 0 0 1em; }
  .pv-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .pv-table th,
  .pv-table td { text-align: left; padding: 0.55rem 1rem 0.55rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); vertical-align: top; }
  .pv-table th { font-weight: 500; }
  .pv-table code { font-family: var(--ff-mono); font-size: 0.85em; }
  .pv-btn { background: none; border: 0; padding: 0; font: inherit; color: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
</style>
